OL,3,GNEWSAMissing student's family calls for
OL,4,Anew enquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe parents of missing student Jack
OL,7,FO'Sullivan are fighting to have his
OL,8,Fcase investigated by a different police
OL,9,Fforce, arguing the current one is
OL,10,F"failing us".
OL,12,FJack O'Sullivan, aged 22 at the time of
OL,13,Fhis disappearance, was last seen in the
OL,14,Fearly hours of 2 March 2024 after
OL,15,Fattending a house party in the Hotwells
OL,16,Farea of Bristol.
OL,18,FDespite scouring more than 100 hours of
OL,19,FCCTV and conducting expert-led searches
OL,20,Fby land and water, Avon and Somerset
OL,21,FPolice have found no trace of him.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
